@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description

state "已计划\n（稳定的触发实例 ID）" as Planned
state "已准入\n（.due 在一次扫描中为 true）" as Admitted
state "已错过\n（原因保留在追踪中）" as Missed

[*] --> Planned
Planned --> Planned : 准入前 provider 修正\n移动计划时间
Planned --> Admitted : 在 Pulse 跨越 / Window /\nRun 延迟启动区间内\n所有条件为 true
Planned --> Missed : ConditionsFalseAtPulse\nObservationGap\nLateStartExpired\nCorrectionPastHighWater\nEventWithdrawn
Admitted --> [*] : 至多一次；\n不重新武装、不重复
Missed --> [*] : 绝不排队\n或重放
@enduml
